# Pins line-ending policy explicitly instead of leaving git to re-guess it
# every status check under core.autocrlf — the guess can false-positive a
# byte-identical file as "modified" (seen repeatedly on
# desktop-studio/src-tauri/Cargo.toml). All TOML in this repo is already
# consistently LF-stored; this just makes that official.
*.toml text eol=lf
